From be7eeb37ed9eb81d123fa56adc9b9352f90e1e85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qlid <qlid@invalid>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 19:51:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 54/54] virtio-mmio: implement shared memory regions

Implement the Virtio 1.2 shared-memory selector, length, and base registers for MMIO transports. Map static descriptors at a machine-provided base, migrate and reset the selector, and reject invalid or overlapping windows.

Add qtests for register semantics, reset, migration, guest mappings, failure paths, GPU hostmem, and the unchanged PCI BAR4 contract.

Assisted-by: LLM
